            "section_title": "2.2. Characterization of the photocatalysts",
            "mentions": [
              {
                "page": 3,
                "text": "The physical and textural properties obtained by means of N2 sorption of the KIT-6 and Ti-KIT-6 materials are shown in Table 1. A noticeable decrease was observed in the surface area and pore volume of KIT-6 after Ti incorporation with different Si/Ti ratios in both dried and calcined samples."
